          {
            "title": "Else",
            "id": 126772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zamiast tworzyć dwie instrukcje <code>if</code>, używamy instrukcji <code>if</code> / <code>else</code>, aby uzyskać ten sam rezultat.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" condition = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" condition {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>else</code>, następnie <code>{</code> i na końcu <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Else",
            "id": 126773,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Instrukcja <code>else</code> w instrukcji <code>if</code> / <code>else</code> zawsze znajduje się na końcu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" condition = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" condition {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"or\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>else</code>, następnie <code>{</code> i na końcu <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
